{
  "id": "1CH.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Ŋakiro A Ŋirwa 15",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yau Daudi Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet Yerusalem alo Kirias-Yearim",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kedau Daudi akiduk ŋakais keŋ lotaun a Daudi, abu kitemonok akibois aŋuna ka Asaduku ka Akuj, ido abu kigurok eema aŋuna ka Asaduku a ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai iŋes, “Mam ituŋanan ice, ŋini edakuni Asaduku mati ŋilepi bon, anerae abu Ekapolon toseu ikes adakit Asaduku ke Ekapolon ka akitiya etic keŋ ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Daudi tocunak Ŋisirael daadaŋ Yerusalem aŋuna ka ayaun Asaduku ke Ekapolon alo Kirias-Yearim, nakibois ŋina abu Daudi kitemok aŋuna ka Asaduku a ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyarau iŋes ŋiletok ka Aron kaapei ka ŋilepi aloletok a ŋituŋa a lu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloletok a Koas, aponi tonyaraunae lu: Uriel ikwapei ekarikon ka ŋiyeneta keŋ amiat ka ŋatomoniarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloletok a Merari, aponi tonyaraunae Asaya ikwapei ekarikon ka ŋiyeneta keŋ ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomoniarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloletok a Gerisom, aponi tonyaraunae Yoel ikwapei ekarikon ka ŋiyeneta keŋ amiat ka ŋatomoniuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloletok ke Elisapan, aponi tonyaraunae Semaya ikwapei ekarikon ka ŋiyeneta keŋ ŋamiae ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloletok ke Eburon, aponi tonyaraunae Eliel ikwapei ekarikon ka ŋiyeneta keŋ ŋatomonikanikauni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloletok a Usiel, aponi tonyaraunae Aminadab ikwapei ekarikon ka ŋiyeneta keŋ amiat ka ŋitomon ka ŋiarei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku, abu Daudi tonyarau Sadok ka Abiasar ŋulu arae ŋisacaradotin ka tonyarau ŋilepi lu: Uriel, Asaya, Yoel, Semaya, Eliel ka Aminadab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema neni kec, “Iyes iraakasi ŋikarikok a ŋituŋa ke ekal a Lepi, emaikina iyes ka ŋilepi ŋuluce kitaleunos, ido toloto yaut Asaduku ke Ekapolon a ŋolo erae Akuj a Isirael, nakibois ŋina adau ayoŋ akitemokin aŋuna keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae aŋuna pa kiponiata iyes ŋilepi yaut iŋes ekiŋaren ne, iŋes abunio Akuj toŋo nooi aŋuna yok, anerae pa aponi iwon kidarae Asaduku ŋin lopite ŋolo amaikina kidarere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi kitaleunos aŋuna ka ayaun Asaduku ke Ekapolon a ŋolo erae Akuj a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai ŋilepi todakut Asaduku ka Akuj eryoŋito aloseketa, iwuakinitae kidiama ŋakito, lopite ŋolo sek ecikitor Moses ikes anakirot ke Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok daŋ Daudi ŋikarikok a ŋilepi toseut ŋikaitotoi kec aruwor ŋikaeok, toeoto ŋieosyo ŋulu ka alelyanu isitiyaete ŋiboro ŋulu eramyo, ikwapei ŋagitae, ŋaduŋgui ka ŋitworoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ŋilepi toseut Eman lokoku a Yoel aneni a ŋikaitotoi keŋ, apotu toseut Asap lokoku a Berekia; toseut alokaitotoi kec alo Merari-Esan lokoku a Kusaia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aŋuna ka akiŋarakin ikes akiram ŋiboro ŋulu eore. Apotu ŋilepi toseut alokidiŋ kec ŋilepi lu: Sakariya, Yasiel, Semiramos, Yeiel, Uni, Eliab, Benaia, Maaseia, Matisia ka Elipeleu ta Mikineia; toseut Obededom ka Yeiel ŋulu arae ŋikedarak ŋipukei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae etic ke Eman, Asap ta Esan aeore eramete ŋitworoi ŋulu etiyaunitae ke eburonis; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arae etic a Sakariya, Asiel, Semiramos, Yeiel, Uni, Eliab, Maaseia ka Benaia aeore eramete ŋaduŋgui, lopite ŋolo aeore ikyaaritae eete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae etic a Matisia, Elipeleu, Mikineia, Obededom, Yeiel ka Asasia aeore eramete ŋagitae lopite ŋolo aeore etikiunitoe eete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenania ekarikon a ŋilepi iŋes apolokinit aeore; arae ŋol etic keŋ, anerae ayeni iŋes aeore nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Berekia ka Elikana ŋiketeok epuke ŋolo elomarere neni ayai Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae etic a ŋisacaradotin a lu: Sebania, Yosapat, Nesanel, Amasai, Sakariya, Benaia ka Elieser akikut ŋarupepe alokiŋaren Asaduku ka Akuj. Etic ka Obededom ka Yeia ece iŋes akidar epuke ŋolo elomarere neni ayai Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Daudi ka ŋikasikou a Ŋisirael ta ŋikarikok a ŋikajiok a ŋalipulipui, toloto akiom Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet ke Ekapolon, oma alokai ka Obededom eeosi ka alelyanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋuna abunio Akuj kiŋarakinia ŋilepi ŋulu adakito Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet ke Ekapolon, apotu ikes toara erae amuronot ŋimoŋin ŋikanikaarei ka ŋimesekin ŋikanikaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, anapit Daudi ekaaso ŋolo ajokan ŋolo amilimilan, lopite ŋolo anapitotor ŋilepi daŋ daadaŋ ŋulu adakito Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet, kaapei ka ŋikaeok ta Kenania ŋolo arae ekarikon a ŋikaeok. Anapit daŋ Daudi arapet ŋina amilimilan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun apotu Ŋisirael daadaŋ yaut Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet ke Ekapolon, ecelasi, tokusete ŋabureryaŋa a ŋimesekin, ŋarupepe, toramete ŋitworoi ka tobolyas ŋagitae ka ŋaduŋgui.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
